## Conclusion

The **Fast Food Cheat Meal Dashboard** transforms consumer and fast-food data into an interactive analytical view. The results highlight differences in fast-food chain representation, consumer activity levels, running-time measurements, and gender-based weight metrics.

With its combination of KPIs, comparative visualizations, and interactive filters, the dashboard provides a practical foundation for understanding consumer behavior and identifying meaningful patterns within fast-food consumption data.

